	(text "FIXED GPIO ALLOCATION\n\nGPIO LOOP A: D32 -> SEL_D33 -> 470R -> D33\nGPIO LOOP B: D25 -> SEL_D26 -> 470R -> D26\nPWM/ADC: D27 -> 10k/100nF -> D34 and MCP3008 CH0\n\nI2C: SDA D21, SCL D22, INT via SEL_D35 to D35, FB to D39\nSPI: SCK D18, MISO D19, MOSI D23, ADC CS D16, FLASH CS D17\nONEWIRE: D13, DS18B20 bus and removable DS2413\nUART0: D1/D3 reserved for REPL and flashing\nUART TEST: D4 -> JP_UART_LOOP2 -> D36\n           D14 -> SEL_D35 -> D35\n\nDEFAULT SELECTOR / SHUNT STATE\n\nSEL_D33: pins 1-2 fitted - D32 to D33 GPIO loop\nSEL_D26: pins 1-2 fitted - D25 to D26 GPIO loop\nSEL_D35: pins 1-2 fitted - I2C_INT to D35\nJP_UART_LOOP2: OPEN\nJP_External_5V1: OPEN\n\nFor UART crosslink testing:\nSEL_D35 pins 2-3 fitted and JP_UART_LOOP2 CLOSED.\n\nD0 reserved for BOOT.\nNo fixed loads on strapping pins D2/D5/D12/D15.\nD6-D11 are module flash signals and must not be used.\nD34-D39 are input-only and have no internal pulls."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 252.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "30b494da-cfc0-4ee5-8167-12567a9c2086")
	)
